OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain continuing for parts of northern
OL,7,FScotland this evening, before more
OL,8,Fpersistent rain arrives into Northern
OL,9,FIreland and western Scotland later.
OL,10,FOtherwise, a mostly dry night although
OL,11,Fcloud tending to increase. A cooler
OL,12,Fnight in the south.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FRather cloudy with showery
OL,15,Flight rain across Scotland and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland. Dry elsewhere, with
OL,17,Fwarm spells of hazy sunshine. Feeling
OL,18,Fpleasant for many, with light winds.
